   "source": [
    "## 12. Inspection of the Selected Features\n",
    "\n",
    "After completing the honest cross-validation experiment, the preprocessing\n",
    "pipeline and multivariate filter are fitted to the complete dataset only for\n",
    "interpretation.\n",
    "\n",
    "This additional fit is not used to estimate classification performance.\n",
    "\n",
    "Its purpose is to inspect which transformed features are selected when\n",
    "relevance to the target and redundancy between predictors are considered\n",
    "simultaneously."
   ]
