  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d18afaf6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The `MutualInformation` column reports only the relevance of each feature with\n",
    "respect to the target.\n",
    "\n",
    "The final multivariate selection also considers redundancy with the features\n",
    "already selected. Therefore, some features with relatively high mutual\n",
    "information may not be selected if they provide information that is largely\n",
    "duplicated by other predictors."
   ]
  },
